menuconfig THINKPAD_T430_STATUS
    bool "ThinkPad T430 indicator LEDs"
    default y if SHIELD_THINKPAD_T430
    depends on ZMK_BLE && ZMK_USB
    help
      Drives the T430 power-button LED with USB/BLE connection status and
      mirrors the dedicated speaker/microphone mute buttons to their LEDs.
